        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We’ve escaped the pass. Well, at least I know that the orcs can be beaten. Hmm, I guess that this is the last I’ll see of my home... and my father. (<i>Sigh</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We should make our way to Southbay. It is the largest city on the Isle. We should be able to make a stand there. Failing that, there’s always Clearwater Port."),
